Third-party notices for @tinyactors/scxmljs
===========================================

@tinyactors/scxmljs depends on the following packages at run time. Only the
sandboxed entry point (`@tinyactors/scxmljs`) loads them; the trusted entry
point (`@tinyactors/scxmljs/trusted`) does not. They are installed as npm
dependencies, not copied into this package; their notices are reproduced here
because bundlers inline them (including the QuickJS WebAssembly binary) into
applications that use the sandboxed entry point.

